From fa6595f62de26e187303409ec7db0068259479d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Agnya <manthram@Pradass-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:44:58 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Fix confirmed bugs found in a full audit of the profile
 dashboard
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Saved Trips showed prices as "$X" instead of "LKR X" (every other
  price display in the app uses LKR), and didn't handle free trips
  at all — a free saved trip showed "$0" instead of "Free Trip".
- Removed the dead TravelPreferences component (~130 lines) — it was
  never actually rendered; the Preferences tab renders
  <PreferencesForm /> directly instead.
- hover:bg-ceylon-green-dark doesn't exist in tailwind.config.ts, so
  the avatar-picker confirm buttons had a dead hover state that did
  nothing. Switched to the working bg-ceylon-green/90 pattern already
  used elsewhere on this page.
- Downloaded data export file was still named
  ceylon-expand-data-<date>.json.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 client/src/pages/me.tsx | 140 ++--------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 136 deletions(-)

diff --git a/client/src/pages/me.tsx b/client/src/pages/me.tsx
index 26a9e01..788766b 100644
--- a/client/src/pages/me.tsx
+++ b/client/src/pages/me.tsx
